      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_7",
      "quote": "the Cochrane Central Register of Controlled Trials (CENTRAL). ... No publication date limitations were set.",
      "reason": "CENTRAL is a study register and its name is reported with no date restrictions noted, but no explicit date restrictions for the register search are stated beyond the overall search date."
